title: RMM Level (filesystem)
description: |
   Level is a remote monitoring and management (RMM) tool. Threat actors has been seen using the automation feature of it. The tool is using OSQuery to collect basic machine information, and will also spawn osqueri.exe.

logsource:
  category: filesystem
  product: windows
  service: glob

detection:
  condition: selection
  selection:
   - OSPath|re:
     - C:\\Program Files\\Level\\.*

details: Detected RMM executable %EventData.OSPath%
enrichment: |
  x=>dict(
   Hash=hash(path=x.EventData.OSPath))
